    "title": "Mercer County to honor Women of Achievement - NewsBreak",
    "text": "16 hours ago Mercer County will recognize five local women and students at its 2026 Women of Achievement Reception on March 18. The Mercer County Commission on the Status of Women announced this year’s Woman of Achievement and Young Woman of Achievement awardees, who will be honored during an evening ceremony at the Boathouse at Mercer Lake in West Windsor. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
